tion count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5343/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.133      1 -total\n 63.32%    8.949      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 35.79%    5.059      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15426:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017005453 and revision id 289617. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}